{"reviewId": "236432639_87J39s0tn", "review": {"abstract": "三周期嵌套", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "chapterUid": 11, "content": "1、短周期：基钦周期（40个月的短周期）--库存\n2、中周期：由法国经济学家朱格拉在1862年提出，又称朱格拉周期。中周期实际上最典型的是资本支出的周期性变化，为此有时也被称为资本支出周期（9-10年）--设备投资\n3、​长波周期：最经典的是苏联经济学家康德拉季耶夫在1925年提出的资本主义经济存在50～60年的周期特征，他以资本主义世界的重大经济危机作为划分依据，该周期也被称为康德拉季耶夫周期，或康波周期--技术革命（工业革命/科技革命）\n\n每个长波周期包括6个中周期，每个中周期包括3个短周期，即多层次三周期嵌套理论", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "author": {"userVid": 236432639, "name": "虫二", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/2R88m4sKyHQS72htXU4QpGaa8L95ljF7gJry4yiaB18ibvXdgH9UZKa2U5yr53mtibVugyCeOsj13we4w41ic0WTcbXPkaHUSk7KoNqYcaiafbDk/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}, "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "8978-8983", "createTime": 1773931046, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 11, "reviewId": "236432639_87J39s0tn", "userVid": 236432639, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1773931768, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "06 结构主义的薪火 周期波动、结构演进与制度变革", "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 22, "likes": [{"userVid": 236432639, "name": "虫二", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/2R88m4sKyHQS72htXU4QpGaa8L95ljF7gJry4yiaB18ibvXdgH9UZKa2U5yr53mtibVugyCeOsj13we4w41ic0WTcbXPkaHUSk7KoNqYcaiafbDk/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "阅读高手🐮", "reviewId": "236432639_87J39s0tn", "commentId": "236432639_87J39s0tn_c545905154_88UTboAUg", "userVid": 545905154, "createTime": 1778125130, "author": {"userVid": 545905154, "name": "癸癸的野望", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELA8K4B6Al1qr4MACibwicyrdic5rhicSxBzxgUZ1UOAGop4volWeXccS19iboZH5SD6WaxZJic8O9AoI4k2KhvgHtEPwRq0GLrSyhrQdDLNYO9glSw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "癸癸的野望", "isV": 0, "vDesc": "癸癸在学习。", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}}], "htmlContent": "基钦周期（40个月的短周期）--库存周期\n朱格拉周期称为中周期，中周期实际上最典型的是资本支出的周期性变化，为此有时也被称为资本支出周期--设备周期\n​长波周期方面，最经典的是苏联经济学家康德拉季耶夫在1925年提出的资本主义经济存在50～60年的周期特征，他以资本主义世界的重大经济危机作为划分依据，该周期也被称为康德拉季耶夫周期，或康波周期--经济周期", "dislikeCount": 0, "synckey": 1793061084}